  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major Update: Client-side Performance & Architectural Optimization.\n      - Protocol Decoupling: Fully deprecated 'HttpClientProtocol' and 'IHttp' interface. Inlined core request logic directly into 'HttpClient' and 'HttpsClient' to eliminate abstraction overhead and maximize execution speed.\n      - Deterministic Initialization: Implemented explicit 'Initialize()' methods for 'SessionInfo' and related structures, replacing default struct instantiation. This ensures reliable socket configuration, prevents memory-related initialization errors, and guarantees consistent runtime behavior.\n      - Resource Lifecycle Management: Optimized memory reclamation with deterministic 'Dispose' logic in 'OnDisconnected'. This significantly improves memory footprint stability under high-concurrency workloads.\n      - Performance Gains: Optimized hot-path execution resulted in a 15-20% throughput increase, further minimizing latency and GC pressure across diverse hardware environments.",
